title: Supabase clients
description: Browser, server, and proxy clients that carry the member's session, plus generated database types. One admin client exists, used only by billing.
connects:
  - to: supabase/migrations
    label: PostgREST and Auth
    description: Queries go through PostgREST with the member's token. Row-level security on every table is the one place access is decided. The generated types in database.types.ts are checked against the migrations in CI.
